    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Happy Parrot avoid increasingly difficult obstacles and see the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but challenging controls: flap to raise, hold flap to glide, sprint to rush ahead and hold sprint to bash walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brief tutorial to show all the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Scenarios with different type of challenges: tropical island, cave and tropical forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually designed levels for a calibrated challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural levels to test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax Mode with simplified mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful environment and themed soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your records and beat them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Help the Happy Parrot avoid increasingly difficult obstacles and see the world!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple but challenging controls: flap to raise, hold flap to glide, sprint to rush ahead and hold sprint to bash walls.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Brief tutorial to show all the gameplay.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Three Scenarios with different type of challenges: tropical island, cave and tropical forest.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Manually designed levels for a calibrated challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural levels to test your skills.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Relax Mode with simplified mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colourful environment and themed soundtrack.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep track of your records and beat them!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
